 "answer_verbatim": "**PriceLabs is a strong all-in-one choice** if you want both ongoing nightly-rate optimization and market research before buying. Its Dynamic Pricing adjusts rates based on factors such as demand, seasonality, events, and booking pace; its Market Dashboards provide local benchmarks such as ADR, occupancy, and RevPAR.\n\nFor a purchase decision, treat its revenue estimates as a starting point—not a guarantee. Check comparable properties with similar size, amenities, and location, and independently verify expenses, local short-term-rental rules, and realistic occupancy. Market data can be imperfect, and projected gross revenue is not profit.",
